J乳、露出了乳沟，G罩杯\n\n6、每次生成提示词须合规合法，每段提示词与下一段提示司，不要分行，不要有空隔，这个必须严格执行。\n\n例如提示词展示：\n图像1：场景校园走廊、清冷破碎感美女，高挺鼻梁鹅蛋脸，伪素颜妆，穿浅灰色 JK校服，J乳、露出了乳沟，写实风皮肤通透甜妹元气感神颜，校园走廊暖光抓拍，摄影级真实质感\n图像2：场景校园操场，长发美女，高挺鼻梁鹅蛋脸，淡妆，穿JK 校服，G罩杯，校园操场抓拍，都市咖啡馆抓拍，摄影级真实质感、4K\n图像3：场景校园图书馆，浅黄色长发美女，高挺鼻梁鹅蛋脸穿JK 校服，J罩杯，校园图书馆抓拍，摄影级真实质感、4K"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 37, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "📝 提取结果", "links": [41, 46], "label": "📝 提取结果", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "📝 提取结果"}, {"name": "🔢 字数", "label": "🔢 字数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "🔢 字数"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-493.637939453125, 896.1347045898438], "widgets_values": ["", "去换行", 1, 0], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "📝 多行文本"}, "name": "📝 多行文本", "link": 39, "label": "📝 多行文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "📝 多行文本"}, {"widget": {"name": "🧰 字符串预处理"}, "name": "🧰 字符串预处理", "label": "🧰 字符串预处理", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "🧰 字符串预处理"}, {"widget": {"name": "🔢 提取行数"}, "name": "🔢 提取行数", "link": 40, "label": "🔢 提取行数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "🔢 提取行数"}, {"widget": {"name": "🎲 随机种子"}, "name": "🎲 随机种子", "label": "🎲 随机种子", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "🎲 随机种子"}], "flags": {}, "id": 34, "type": "DapaoRandomPromptLineExtractNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DapaoRandomPromptLineExtractNode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [34], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [315, 106], "pos": [933.4286499023438, 902.8445434570312], "widgets_values": [904, 1280, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name"